{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-cyclotomic-strand-doubling","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proof","doco:Section"],"label":"prf:cyclotomic-strand-doubling","kind":"proof","title":"Proof of cyclotomic strand doubling","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-cyclotomic-strand-doubling"],"text":"cyclotomic-strand-doubling-proof.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"prf:cyclotomic-strand-doubling\"></a>\n<strong>Proof.</strong> <em>Proof of cyclotomic strand doubling</em></p>\n<p><strong>Proof.</strong> By direct evaluation, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_4(X) = X^2 + 1</code> and\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_8(X) = X^4 + 1</code>. Composing <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_4</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">X^2</code> gives\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(X^2)^2 + 1 = X^4 + 1 = \\Phi_8(X)</code>. ∎</p>\n"}
